{"availability":"available","full":"MakeBoldSolutions/UISampleSpark","name":"UISampleSpark","description":"An application to demonstrate multiple ways of implementing simple maintenance (CRUD) and user interface in ASP.Net using latest public versions. ","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":8,"forks":4,"created":"2019-04-25T18:45:29Z","updated":"2026-09-30T13:04:38Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ui.makeboldspark.com","topics":["asp-net","asp-net-core","asp-net-core-web-api","asp-net-web-api","aspnet-mvc","bootstrap4","c-sharp","crud","mvc-application"],"demo":"https://ui.makeboldspark.com/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.696Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.696Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.696Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.696Z","stars":8,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A .NET 10 (ASP.NET Core) application exploring multiple front-end technologies for building modern web user interfaces. This repository is an educational reference that compares UI patterns — MVC, Razor Pages, React, Vue, htmx, Blazor, and vanilla JavaScript SPA — using a common Employee/Department domain, with theming, containerization, and deployment examples.","UISampleSpark demonstrates how the same Employee/Department CRUD domain can be implemented across seven distinct front-end UI patterns — MVC, Razor Pages, jQuery AJAX, React, Vue, htmx, and Blazor — within a single ASP.NET Core application. It covers theming, containerization, REST APIs, and CI/CD.","Built by Mark Hazleton — Technical Solutions Architect Part of the MakeBoldSpark portfolio of technical demonstrations."],"features":["MVC Controllers & Views — traditional multi-view pattern (/MvcEmployee)","jQuery AJAX + Partial Views — modal-based UI without full page reloads (/Employee)","Razor Pages — page-centric model (/EmployeeRazor)","Single Page Application (SPA) — JavaScript/AJAX with DataTables and REST API (/EmployeeSinglePage)","React SPA — component-based UI with React 18, hooks, and Fetch API (/EmployeeReact)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MakeBoldSolutions/UISampleSpark/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4e13d4cd90347a8086c0e9b7dd39e2083b34c254f2146b04b53471f65ee7e809","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:18.677Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:15.937Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A .NET 10 (ASP.NET Core) application exploring multiple front-end technologies for building modern web user interfaces. This repository is an educational reference that compares UI patterns — MVC, Razor Pages, React, Vue, htmx, Blazor, and vanilla JavaScript SPA — using a common Employee/Department domain, with theming, containerization, and deployment examples.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MakeBoldSolutions/UISampleSpark/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"4e13d4cd90347a8086c0e9b7dd39e2083b34c254f2146b04b53471f65ee7e809","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MakeBoldSolutions/UISampleSpark/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:15.938Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-30T13:04:38Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:15.939Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MakeBoldSolutions/UISampleSpark/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:15.938Z","hash":"4e13d4cd90347a8086c0e9b7dd39e2083b34c254f2146b04b53471f65ee7e809","originalBytes":7442,"storedBytes":7442,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","docker","net","react","repository","core","mvc","theming","application","blazor","bootswatch","domain","health","pages","razor","theme","uisamplespark","via","vue","ajax","azure","data","employee","hazleton","htmx","key","live","mark","patterns","rest","run","service","spa","swagger","unit","apikeys","architecture","asp.net","bootstrap","containerization","department","endpoints","front-end","image","license","multiple","openapi","patte